@startuml autonomous-capability-execution-boundary
title Autonomous Capability Execution Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Autonomous Capability\n<<semantic>>" as acap
class "Execution Mechanism\n<<technology>>" as exec

acap --> exec : realized through

note right of exec
  May be:
  - human-supported
  - automated
  - agentic
  - system-mediated
  - service-mediated
  - hybrid
end note

note bottom of acap
  Material agentic behavior
  required per CR-ES-013 §8
end note
@enduml
